      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:5:2:24:1",
      "text": [
        " قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) لَا يُبَاعُ الدَّيْنُ بِالدَّيْنِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhamamd Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Ibn Mahboub, from Ibrahim Bin Mihzam, from Talha Bin Yazeed, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> said: ‘Do not sell the debt by the debt’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "1. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from ibn Mahbub from Ibrahim ibn Mihzam from Talhah ibn Yazid who has said the following: “Abu ‘ Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said that the Messenger of Allah has said, ’It is not lawful to buy a debt with debt (on credit).”’ "
        ]
      }
    },
